### Lab 2 – Order Processing: HTTP Requests

@workerUrl = http://localhost:8094
@mockApiUrl = http://localhost:8089

### ===== DEPLOY =====

### Deploy BPMN + DMN
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/deploy

### ===== TOPOLOGY =====

### Zeebe Connection Check
GET {{workerUrl}}/workflow/topology

### ===== TC-L2-01: STANDARD ORDER SUCCESS =====

### Standard customer, in-stock item, success payment token
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerRef": "SYN-CUST-001",
  "customerCategory": "STANDARD",
  "productId": "PROD-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "deliveryPreference": "STANDARD",
  "paymentToken": "tok_test_success"
}

### ===== TC-L2-02: GOLD CUSTOMER EXPRESS =====

POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerRef": "SYN-CUST-002",
  "customerCategory": "GOLD",
  "productId": "PROD-002",
  "quantity": 2,
  "deliveryPreference": "EXPRESS",
  "paymentToken": "tok_test_success"
}

### ===== TC-L2-03: OUT OF STOCK =====

### Product not in inventory – Expected: Stock Failure end event
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerRef": "SYN-CUST-003",
  "customerCategory": "STANDARD",
  "productId": "PROD-OUT-OF-STOCK",
  "quantity": 1,
  "deliveryPreference": "STANDARD",
  "paymentToken": "tok_test_success"
}

### ===== TC-L2-04: DECLINED PAYMENT =====

### Valid stock but payment declined – Expected: Payment Failed end event
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerRef": "SYN-CUST-004",
  "customerCategory": "STANDARD",
  "productId": "PROD-003",
  "quantity": 2,
  "deliveryPreference": "STANDARD",
  "paymentToken": "tok_test_declined"
}

### ===== TC-L2-05: HIGH VALUE (MANUAL VERIFICATION) =====

### NEXT_DAY delivery + STANDARD customer → triggers manual review
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerRef": "SYN-CUST-005",
  "customerCategory": "STANDARD",
  "productId": "PROD-001",
  "quantity": 5,
  "deliveryPreference": "NEXT_DAY",
  "paymentToken": "tok_test_success"
}

### ===== PAYMENT API DIRECT CALL =====

### Direct payment charge (bypasses process)
POST {{mockApiUrl}}/payments/charge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerRef": "SYN-CUST-DIRECT",
  "paymentToken": "tok_test_success",
  "orderTotal": 299.99
}

### ===== FAILURE INJECTION =====

### Enable payment API failure mode
POST {{mockApiUrl}}/admin/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": true}

### Disable payment API failure mode
POST {{mockApiUrl}}/admin/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": false}

### Enable worker failure mode
POST {{workerUrl}}/worker-config/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": true}

### Disable worker failure mode
POST {{workerUrl}}/worker-config/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": false}

### ===== STATUS =====

GET {{mockApiUrl}}/health
GET {{mockApiUrl}}/admin/status
GET {{workerUrl}}/actuator/health
GET {{workerUrl}}/worker-config/status

